      "writtenOn": "2013-08-22T01:19:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t understand this sentence. why would notifications be implemented in the Manager classes?\n\nIt might be useful to allow passing in the context as an optional parameter... but if it\u0027s not used now then might as well wait until it\u0027s actually useful since it\u0027s easy to change.",
      "revId": "652d5bd1cf10c8c5719c0d59e0e7238ea263205e",
